  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Education Protection and health respons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program intends to provide education services to children and caregivers, tailored to their unique needs, alongside mental health support and increase awareness. It will also offer a cross-cutting protection intervention for Syrian refugees</narrative>
